{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder with avgpool aggregation, isolating aggregation's effect on a less effective encoder. Validation accuracy of 0.591 and F1 of 0.573 suggest multiprofile aggregation improves performance compared to singleprofile baselines, but underperforms relative to scvi_n200 encoders in similar configurations. The exact contribution of aggregation versus encoder quality remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative encoders or aggregation strategies."
}

